{"suttaId":"tha-ap111","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5330,5357],"vripara":"53"},"segments":{"tha-ap111:0.3":"Biḷālidāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap111:1.1":"“Himavantassāvidūre, vasāmi paṇṇasanthare;","tha-ap111:1.3":"Ghāsesu gedhamāpanno, seyyasīlo cahaṃ [seyasīlovahaṃ (syā. ka.)] tadā.","tha-ap111:2.1":"“Khaṇantālu [khaṇamālu (syā.)] kalambāni, biḷālitakkalāni ca;","tha-ap111:2.3":"Kolaṃ bhallātakaṃ billaṃ, āhatvā paṭiyāditaṃ.","tha-ap111:3.1":"“Padumuttaro lokavidū, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho;","tha-ap111:3.3":"Mama saṅkappamaññāya, āgacchi mama santikaṃ.","tha-ap111:4.1":"“Upāgataṃ mahānāgaṃ, devadevaṃ narāsabhaṃ;","tha-ap111:4.3":"Biḷāliṃ paggahetvāna, pattamhi okiriṃ ahaṃ.","tha-ap111:5.1":"“Paribhuñji mahāvīro, tosayanto mamaṃ tadā;","tha-ap111:5.3":"Paribhuñjitvāna sabbaññū, imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsatha.","tha-ap111:6.1":"“‘Sakaṃ cittaṃ pasādetvā, biḷāliṃ me adā tuvaṃ;","tha-ap111:6.3":"Kappānaṃ satasahassaṃ, duggatiṃ nupapajjasi’.","tha-ap111:7.1":"“Carimaṃ vattate mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap111:7.3":"Dhāremi antimaṃ dehaṃ, sammāsambuddhasāsane.","tha-ap111:8.1":"“Catupaññāsito kappe, sumekhaliyasavhayo;","tha-ap111:8.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap111:9.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap111:10.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā biḷālidāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap111:11.1":"Biḷālidāyakattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2835,"to":2835,"paras":[{"para":2835,"vripara":"53","refs":["tha-ap111:1"],"lines":["So aparabhāge attano kusalakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>himavantassāvidūre</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ sabbaṃ heṭṭhā vuttanayattā uttānatthameva.","Āluvakarambhādayo tesaṃ tesaṃ kandajātīnaṃ nāmānevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap111:1"],["tha-ap111:1"],["tha-ap111:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap111:1.1","himavantassāvidūre",0,0]]},"tika":null}
